  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity details our work on Equity Accelerator Fundings in Sudan (the) through the provision of budget and transaction data.  We also provide the relevant documents that guide these activities, which are the support request proposal(s) provided by the Government of Sudan (the), as well as the decision letter(s) issued by Gavi, for progress.  These documents describe the activities, the objectives as well as the beneficiaries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
